# Project: Finja - Twitch Interactivity Suite
# Module: finja-instagram / .dockerignore
# Author: J. Apps (JohnV2002 / Sodakiller1)
# Version: 1.2.0
# Description: Keeps secrets, tests and tooling state out of the image.
# New in v1.2.0: Tests, contracts and tool state stay out (analytics_contract.json stays in:
#   the sender reads it).
